# Google Maps JavaScript API key for the interactive map on the contact page.
#
# 1. Copy this file to `.env` and paste your key below.
# 2. Set the SAME variable in Cloudflare Pages > Settings >
#    Environment variables (Production + Preview).
#
# This key is exposed in the built HTML (normal for the Maps JS API).
# Protect it in Google Cloud Console by restricting it to:
#   - Application: HTTP referrers -> tylerfridgepro.com/*, *.tylerfridgepro.com/*
#     (add http://localhost:4321/* for local dev)
#   - API: "Maps JavaScript API" only
#
# If unset, the contact page falls back to the keyless map embed.
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
